      {
        "value": "C",
        "text": "1142.9 mm^2"
      },
      {
        "value": "D",
        "text": "571.4 mm^2"
      }
    ],
    "correct_answer": "D",
    "explanation": "Additional compression force is 80x10^6/400=200000 N. Area=200000/350=571.4 mm^2."
  },
  {
    "display_order": 140,
    "question_text": "[Steel Structures & Prestressed Concrete] For a 200 mm wide, 10 mm thick plate, a candidate zigzag path crosses two 22 mm holes with stagger s=40 mm and gauge g=80 mm. Use bn=b-sum(dh)+s^2/(4g). Its net area is:",
    "options": [
