    "correct_answer": "C",
    "explanation": "bn=200-44+1600/320=161 mm; area=161x10=1610 mm^2. Other possible paths must still be compared."
  },
  {
    "display_order": 141,
    "question_text": "[Fluid Mechanics & Hydraulic Machines] An open suction tank has atmospheric head 10.3 m, vapour head 0.3 m, pump centre 4 m above water and suction loss 1 m. NPSH available is:",
    "options": [
      {
        "value": "A",
